WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 13=

02:05.160 --> 02:05.760
Father,

02:06.480 --> 02:08.479
we usually hunt for fun every year.

02:08.840 --> 02:10.039
Now that everyone's gathered,

02:10.600 --> 02:12.120
why don't we turn it into a competition

02:12.400 --> 02:13.920
and see who bags the most?

02:16.200 --> 02:17.800
That's not a bad idea.

02:18.880 --> 02:19.480
Your Majesty,

02:19.680 --> 02:21.280
why not turn it into a contest?

02:21.760 --> 02:24.560
Let's see the prowess
of Qi's finest men.

02:25.160 --> 02:26.880
If that's what you want,

02:27.200 --> 02:28.240
so be it.

02:29.240 --> 02:30.520
Whoever earns

02:31.040 --> 02:32.480
the top score today,

02:33.200 --> 02:33.880
I

02:34.240 --> 02:36.320
shall reward the winner

02:36.520 --> 02:37.440
with the Ferghana horse.

02:38.280 --> 02:40.600
- Your Majesty is wise indeed!
- Your Majesty is wise indeed!

02:43.720 --> 02:45.960
Chancellor Shen, I've heard you excel
in civil affairs and martial skills.

02:46.040 --> 02:48.360
Do you think you'll take the lead today?

02:50.320 --> 02:52.040
It's too soon to tell.

02:52.680 --> 02:54.640
Your Highness, do you wish to compete?

02:58.720 --> 02:59.320
Shen Zaiye,

03:01.000 --> 03:02.360
I underestimated you yesterday.

03:03.240 --> 03:05.280
But I won't go easy on you today.

03:06.480 --> 03:08.320
I'll look forward to it.

03:24.280 --> 03:31.280
- Hyah! Go! Hyah!
- Hyah! Hyaah! Hyah!

03:37.960 --> 03:38.680
Be very careful.

03:39.000 --> 03:40.000
Make sure you're not seen.

03:42.800 --> 03:43.920
This is a dangerous move.

03:44.080 --> 03:45.080
Be extra careful.

03:59.040 --> 03:59.760
Whoa!

04:01.720 --> 04:02.440
Easy now!

04:05.160 --> 04:05.880
Easy!

04:13.160 --> 04:14.480
Let's see

04:14.600 --> 04:15.440
if your stubbornness

04:15.520 --> 04:16.839
or my whip takes over!

04:17.680 --> 04:18.279
Go!

04:30.160 --> 04:30.760
Easy!

04:38.000 --> 04:39.760
The horse is out of control! Help me!

04:44.360 --> 04:44.960
Easy!

04:45.280 --> 04:46.960
Hyah! Hyah! Hyaah!

04:47.320 --> 04:49.120
The horse's gone wild!
Clear the way!

04:49.200 --> 04:50.400
Watch out!

04:53.240 --> 04:53.960
Hold!

04:55.920 --> 04:56.520
Stop!

05:07.760 --> 05:09.000
Get out of the way!

05:24.480 --> 05:25.200
Are you all right?

05:27.440 --> 05:28.680
They say

05:28.800 --> 05:30.360
greatness runs in the family.

05:30.640 --> 05:32.480
Prince Wuxia may seem mild.

05:32.760 --> 05:33.760
But he's got courage.

05:39.040 --> 05:39.640
I'm tired.

05:40.320 --> 05:41.320
Come back with me.

05:41.640 --> 05:43.400
Let's see what trophies
everyone's caught.

05:46.040 --> 05:46.680
My dear, come.

05:48.160 --> 05:49.520
Mu Wuxia, are you out of your mind?

05:49.720 --> 05:50.920
You don't even know martial arts.

05:51.000 --> 05:52.240
What if the horse trampled you?

05:53.040 --> 05:54.240
Well, I couldn't just watch

05:54.440 --> 05:55.720
you fall off the horse.

05:56.320 --> 05:57.640
What if something bad happened?

05:59.560 --> 06:00.680
I'm trained in martial arts.

06:01.080 --> 06:02.520
A little fall won't hurt me.

06:04.840 --> 06:05.440
What is it?

06:06.400 --> 06:07.000
My ankle…

06:09.000 --> 06:09.840
Over here.

06:20.200 --> 06:20.880
Does it hurt here?

06:26.840 --> 06:27.760
It's nothing serious.

06:28.840 --> 06:29.760
It's just a sprain.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.280
What were you doing here anyway?

06:37.400 --> 06:38.120
I…

06:39.160 --> 06:41.680
I only wanted a quiet place

06:41.760 --> 06:42.560
to read.

06:43.280 --> 06:44.680
Then you showed up and disturbed me.

06:46.400 --> 06:48.360
It's that horse's fault
for making me lose face.

06:50.160 --> 06:51.440
Miss, are you hurt?

06:52.520 --> 06:53.600
That horse is too wild.

06:53.680 --> 06:54.720
It could've hurt you badly.

06:54.800 --> 06:55.960
We'll put it down right away.

06:57.640 --> 06:58.240
Wait.

07:09.920 --> 07:11.200
It was only spooked.

07:11.560 --> 07:12.600
There's no need for that.

07:14.960 --> 07:15.560
It's all right.

07:50.680 --> 07:51.800
Report!

07:52.160 --> 07:54.480
Prince Wugou has two more kills!

07:55.200 --> 07:57.960
- Prince Wugou has two more kills!
- Prince Wugou has another two!

07:58.680 --> 08:01.080
(Mu Wugou. 7)

08:04.560 --> 08:05.400
Report!

08:06.040 --> 08:08.400
(Shen Zaiye. 10)
Chancellor Shen adds three more!

08:13.840 --> 08:15.440
Your Highness, I found it!

08:16.240 --> 08:17.040
Found it.

08:24.680 --> 08:25.320
Come.

08:29.320 --> 08:30.200
Report!

08:30.560 --> 08:33.320
(Shen Zaiye. 10)
Prince Wugou has another two kills!

08:34.880 --> 08:35.760
Report!

08:36.120 --> 08:38.440
(Shen Zaiye. 15)
Chancellor Shen has 15 kills!

08:45.440 --> 08:46.240
Report!

08:46.320 --> 08:46.920
(Mu Wugou. 19)

08:47.000 --> 08:49.120
(Shen Zaiye. 22)
Chancellor Shen has 22 kills!

08:49.800 --> 08:51.200
Chancellor Shen is impressive indeed.

08:51.280 --> 08:52.360
A true scholar and warrior.

08:55.840 --> 08:57.760
Who knew his skills
in archery and riding

08:57.840 --> 08:59.080
were this sharp?

09:00.720 --> 09:02.160
It looks like the prize will go to

09:02.400 --> 09:04.640
either Prince Wugou or Chancellor Shen.

09:04.720 --> 09:06.720
He always sets his sights

09:07.840 --> 09:08.920
and never misses.

09:24.800 --> 09:25.480
Are you certain?

09:27.120 --> 09:28.200
There may be some distance.

09:28.480 --> 09:30.480
But I've seen
Chancellor Shen's archery before.

09:30.880 --> 09:32.080
His technique today feels off.

09:32.880 --> 09:34.280
If that's not him,

09:34.880 --> 09:36.120
and this is just a decoy,

09:36.640 --> 09:38.480
what exactly is he plotting?

09:46.320 --> 09:47.560
Your meal is ready! Time to eat!

09:47.800 --> 09:48.760
Come and get your food!

09:51.760 --> 09:54.040
The food has gone bad!
How are we supposed to eat this?

09:54.120 --> 09:55.200
Prince Wugou let you rest

09:55.360 --> 09:56.560
because of the spring hunt.

09:56.680 --> 09:58.880
You have the opportunity to rest,
but you are making a fuss about it.

09:58.960 --> 10:00.120
Complaining, huh?

10:01.080 --> 10:02.080
Not eating, huh?

10:02.520 --> 10:03.680
Are you going to eat it or not?

10:03.760 --> 10:04.600
Not eating, huh?

10:15.040 --> 10:15.640
This is bad.

10:17.880 --> 10:18.480
Zhenzhen,

10:18.840 --> 10:20.880
I need you to do something for me.

10:23.160 --> 10:24.600
Eat it even if the food is spoiled!

10:25.920 --> 10:26.920
Take this for not eating.

10:27.800 --> 10:28.800
Are you eating or not?

10:31.120 --> 10:31.920
Not eating, huh?

10:33.800 --> 10:34.960
That'll teach you to be picky.

10:38.920 --> 10:39.720
Still not eating?

10:40.720 --> 10:41.480
Take this!

10:55.200 --> 10:56.040
What's wrong, Huaijin?

10:56.120 --> 10:56.760
We have trouble.

10:57.640 --> 10:58.480
That's not Shen Zaiye.

10:58.560 --> 10:59.640
Someone's impersonating him.

10:59.720 --> 11:00.320
What?

11:01.160 --> 11:03.280
Could he have gone to find those miners?

11:04.120 --> 11:04.720
Calm down.

11:05.240 --> 11:07.000
I'll send some men
to the mine holding site

11:07.080 --> 11:08.000
to kill him now.

11:08.640 --> 11:10.960
If we can kill him,
we'll be rid of the threat for good.

11:13.320 --> 11:13.960
Good.

11:27.920 --> 11:29.320
Where is Meng Huaijin headed?

11:30.440 --> 11:31.200
Someone just reported

11:31.280 --> 11:33.800
that he's going back to the camp
to check the hunting's spoils.

11:34.000 --> 11:35.800
Do you think he's getting suspicious?

11:36.400 --> 11:38.000
You keep playing the role
of Chancellor Shen.

11:38.080 --> 11:39.640
He may already be onto us.

11:40.680 --> 11:41.920
He may look calm and gentle.

11:42.440 --> 11:44.600
But when he strikes,
it's swift and merciless.

11:45.880 --> 11:46.840
And you?

11:46.920 --> 11:49.800
I'm going to find Prince Wuxia
to help Chancellor Shen. We'll split up.

12:00.400 --> 12:02.400
Guard the cave entrance.
Don't let anything go wrong.

12:02.480 --> 12:03.240
Yes, sir.

12:04.880 --> 12:05.760
Unlock the prison gate.

12:05.920 --> 12:06.520
Yes, sir.

12:09.160 --> 12:10.280
Out you go, now!

12:10.880 --> 12:13.120
- Let's go.
- Let's get out of here.

12:13.640 --> 12:14.240
Sir,

12:14.680 --> 12:15.600
you are…

12:15.720 --> 12:17.360
No time to explain. We'll talk later.

12:18.560 --> 12:19.560
- Thank you!
- Everyone, keep up!

12:19.640 --> 12:20.400
Thank you, sir!

12:20.480 --> 12:22.560
We're saved! We're finally saved!

12:23.520 --> 12:24.480
- Hurry.
- Let's go.

12:24.560 --> 12:25.320
Hurry.

12:29.360 --> 12:30.080
Watch out!

12:32.560 --> 12:34.400
Fall back! Take cover!

12:36.800 --> 12:37.400
Run!

12:41.720 --> 12:42.800
Block them with something.

12:44.200 --> 12:44.800
Use the crates!

12:46.720 --> 12:47.560
Get behind something!

12:54.640 --> 12:56.080
Leave no one alive!

13:06.560 --> 13:07.360
(Prince Wuxia.)

13:16.760 --> 13:17.880
Good afternoon, Zhenzhen.

13:19.440 --> 13:22.080
Do you also find the weather hot?

13:22.320 --> 13:23.680
Let me find you an umbrella.

13:25.480 --> 13:26.200
No need.

13:26.440 --> 13:28.480
No need for all the formalities
when we're out here.

13:31.720 --> 13:33.080
This place is full of bugs.

13:33.400 --> 13:34.560
You're delicate by nature.

13:34.640 --> 13:36.000
Let's not get you bitten by any.

13:36.600 --> 13:38.400
Let me get you some repellent.

13:41.720 --> 13:42.880
No need to trouble yourself.

13:43.840 --> 13:46.080
It's nearly the Shen hour.

13:46.440 --> 13:47.720
Since Chancellor Shen isn't here,

13:48.120 --> 13:50.960
why don't we chat for a while?

14:01.280 --> 14:02.720
Go! Break through their line!

14:03.680 --> 14:05.600
Hold the front! Don't let them in!

14:11.880 --> 14:12.520
Sir,

14:13.400 --> 14:14.400
you're a good man.

14:15.760 --> 14:16.680
Please,

14:17.520 --> 14:20.640
get them out of here.

14:21.600 --> 14:24.600
Help them return to their families.

14:25.000 --> 14:27.000
All right. I promise you.

14:42.120 --> 14:43.520
Please help us.

14:43.600 --> 14:44.280
Save us!

14:44.360 --> 14:45.440
We don't want to die.

14:46.040 --> 14:47.080
Please save us, kind sir.

14:47.160 --> 14:48.120
Please save us.

14:48.200 --> 14:49.520
- Help us.
- I don't want to die.

14:49.800 --> 14:51.320
- Save us.
- I don't want to die here.

14:52.440 --> 14:53.240
Kind sir…

14:53.640 --> 14:55.840
- I'm begging you.
- Please save us.

14:56.840 --> 14:58.640
Please save us.

14:58.960 --> 15:00.120
Kind sir.

15:00.760 --> 15:03.160
We don't want to die.

15:30.000 --> 15:31.040
- Sir!
- Sir!

15:44.560 --> 15:45.240
Kill him!

15:45.560 --> 15:47.800
- Kill!
- Kill!

16:20.080 --> 16:22.720
(Mu Wugou. 27)

16:22.840 --> 16:24.600
(Shen Zaiye. 35)

16:26.000 --> 16:28.240
Prince Wugou adds another two kills!

16:29.320 --> 16:31.080
It looks like
Prince Wugou is catching up.

16:31.520 --> 16:33.680
Why hasn't Chancellor Shen
made a move yet?

16:35.800 --> 16:36.640
Zhenzhen,

16:37.840 --> 16:39.400
this sun is too much.

16:40.280 --> 16:42.520
I'm starting to get a headache.

16:43.400 --> 16:44.840
I think I'll head back to rest.

16:45.920 --> 16:48.480
What's this?
You usually address me intimately.

16:48.720 --> 16:50.320
But now you won't even accompany me

16:50.400 --> 16:51.160
a little longer?

16:51.760 --> 16:52.480
Today,

16:52.920 --> 16:55.000
I want you to watch
the rest of this match with me.

16:57.040 --> 16:57.800
What if

16:58.560 --> 16:59.960
I insist on leaving now?

17:05.599 --> 17:07.319
You're a married woman now.

17:07.599 --> 17:08.800
With your husband absent,

17:09.040 --> 17:10.960
the legitimate wife calls the shots.

17:12.040 --> 17:13.480
If you walk away,

17:13.839 --> 17:15.520
I'll go straight to His Majesty

17:16.200 --> 17:17.119
and accuse you

17:17.599 --> 17:19.040
of being arrogant

17:19.800 --> 17:20.760
and disrespectful.

17:23.760 --> 17:25.839
I am feeling quite unwell

17:25.920 --> 17:27.240
and would like to get some rest.

17:27.760 --> 17:28.640
Surely His Majesty

17:28.920 --> 17:30.760
wouldn't be so harsh?

17:33.160 --> 17:36.040
His Majesty has always been thoughtful.

17:36.680 --> 17:37.960
If we start arguing,

17:38.120 --> 17:39.960
he'll likely summon Chancellor Shen

17:40.560 --> 17:42.480
and give us both fifty lashes.

17:43.440 --> 17:44.120
But

17:45.960 --> 17:47.760
is that what you want?

18:09.560 --> 18:10.760
Out of all the men at this hunt,

18:10.840 --> 18:12.400
the one I envy most is Chancellor Shen.

18:14.280 --> 18:15.240
A beauty on each arm.

18:17.840 --> 18:18.440
Lady Jiang,

18:19.040 --> 18:20.440
I hear you're quite skilled at chess.

18:20.520 --> 18:22.400
The competition won't be over
anytime soon anyway.

18:22.480 --> 18:23.800
Why don't we head to the tea room

18:24.200 --> 18:25.120
for a match?

18:31.800 --> 18:34.040
Your Highness,
why aren't you joining the hunt?

18:35.320 --> 18:38.000
Horseback archery used to be for fun.

18:38.520 --> 18:40.440
Now, it's full of rules and rankings.

18:40.600 --> 18:41.920
So it has lost its charm.

18:42.080 --> 18:43.840
Let Wugou
and Chancellor Shen fight it out.

18:44.720 --> 18:47.600
I'm quite happy sitting, drinking tea,
and playing chess with you.

18:48.520 --> 18:51.560
I'm afraid I'm not very good at chess.

18:52.200 --> 18:54.040
I hope you won't mind.

18:55.200 --> 18:57.400
You can't be worse than Chancellor Shen.

18:57.920 --> 19:00.280
Even His Majesty says
he's hopeless at chess.

19:03.920 --> 19:04.560
Madam,

19:05.000 --> 19:07.000
you still need to watch over things
for Chancellor Shen.

19:07.120 --> 19:08.400
So I won't be inviting you along.

19:30.760 --> 19:32.360
I'll go back to the tent to change,

19:32.440 --> 19:33.360
and I'll be right back.

19:34.200 --> 19:34.800
No rush.

19:35.280 --> 19:36.400
Lady Jiang, do as you wish.

19:41.320 --> 19:42.400
Thank you, Your Highness.

20:10.440 --> 20:11.440
Get yourselves together!

20:11.600 --> 20:12.640
He's already out of energy.

20:13.000 --> 20:15.280
Kill him
and you'll be handsomely rewarded!

20:15.360 --> 20:15.960
Charge!

20:19.840 --> 20:21.760
Those who are alive,
fight your way out with me!

20:51.920 --> 20:54.880
Time's up! The hunt is over!

20:58.080 --> 21:00.160
Prince Wugou has 35 kills.

21:00.520 --> 21:02.600
Chancellor Shen has 36 kills.

21:04.600 --> 21:07.400
Father, you have a subject
with such skill and valor.

21:07.760 --> 21:09.200
He's truly a blessing to Qi.

21:10.080 --> 21:11.280
When I first met

21:11.640 --> 21:12.880
Minister Shen,

21:12.960 --> 21:15.680
it was exactly this mastery in riding
and archery that caught my eye.

21:17.240 --> 21:17.920
Wugou,

21:18.720 --> 21:19.840
you still have to work hard.

21:20.840 --> 21:23.120
Father, I admit I'm no match
to Chancellor Shen.

21:23.840 --> 21:25.600
But since Chancellor Shen won,

21:25.800 --> 21:26.920
why hasn't he shown himself?

21:27.680 --> 21:30.400
Could it be the prize
isn't good enough for him?

21:32.360 --> 21:33.960
Shall I go bring him here

21:34.480 --> 21:35.360
to explain?

21:44.920 --> 21:47.360
I humbly thank Your Majesty.

22:02.800 --> 22:03.600
Minister Shen,

22:05.120 --> 22:06.040
these prizes

22:06.800 --> 22:07.600
are yours.

22:08.240 --> 22:09.280
Thank you, Your Majesty.

22:09.720 --> 22:11.400
And thank you,
Prince Wugou, for yielding.

22:14.200 --> 22:14.800
Everyone,

22:15.400 --> 22:18.240
let's go and see Minister Shen's prize.

22:18.680 --> 22:19.280
Let's go.

22:33.680 --> 22:34.440
Prince Wugou.

22:37.520 --> 22:38.320
I win.

22:49.760 --> 22:51.160
Lady Jiang, please, go ahead.

22:54.000 --> 22:55.000
Thank you, Your Highness.

23:31.600 --> 23:32.280
Princess Taohua.

23:33.280 --> 23:35.920
Qingtai, wait outside and keep watch.

23:36.000 --> 23:36.920
Don't let anyone come near.

23:37.000 --> 23:37.760
Yes, Your Highness.

23:40.120 --> 23:40.960
Were they rescued?

23:41.520 --> 23:43.440
Thanks to your warning,
I got there just in time.

23:43.520 --> 23:44.560
When I arrived,

23:44.720 --> 23:46.240
they had just moved everyone to safety.

23:47.040 --> 23:47.800
That's wonderful.

23:48.480 --> 23:50.520
Lian will finally be reunited
with her brother.

23:58.000 --> 23:59.240
The other workers said

24:00.120 --> 24:01.040
Lian's brother

24:01.880 --> 24:02.960
used all his wages

24:03.040 --> 24:04.200
in exchange for this.

24:04.880 --> 24:06.840
He thought
it would look beautiful on her.

24:12.240 --> 24:14.200
He was worried about Lian and Granny.

24:14.720 --> 24:16.520
So he tried to escape alone.

24:18.440 --> 24:19.080
Get him!

24:21.720 --> 24:22.440
Stop right there!

24:29.040 --> 24:29.760
Trying to run, eh?

24:30.040 --> 24:31.840
But the guards caught him

24:33.400 --> 24:34.520
and beat him to death.

24:38.200 --> 24:39.000
Beat him to death!

24:50.360 --> 24:51.120
Your Highness.

24:54.240 --> 24:56.320
Your Highness, what's the matter?

25:02.360 --> 25:03.040
Lian

25:03.320 --> 25:04.840
will never see her brother again.

25:06.480 --> 25:07.320
Do you think…

25:08.920 --> 25:09.840
Do you think Changjue

25:11.040 --> 25:11.760
is…

25:13.440 --> 25:14.120
No.

25:14.360 --> 25:15.760
You must stay strong, Your Highness.

25:16.120 --> 25:17.440
You're not like Lian.

25:17.640 --> 25:19.960
Prince Changjue is still waiting
for you in Beiyuan.

25:23.080 --> 25:23.720
You're right.

25:26.560 --> 25:28.160
Changjue is waiting.

25:30.000 --> 25:30.800
Your Highness,

25:30.920 --> 25:31.840
there's one more thing.

25:33.000 --> 25:35.680
I just overheard
Prince Wugou and Meng Huaijin.

25:36.680 --> 25:37.720
They've sent someone

25:38.200 --> 25:40.120
to assassinate
the treacherous Chancellor today.

25:43.280 --> 25:45.440
Official Meng. Your Highness.
I have bad news.

25:45.520 --> 25:48.000
Chancellor Shen just sent some men
to rescue all the miners.

25:48.880 --> 25:50.040
I told you

25:50.600 --> 25:51.640
we should've killed them.

25:52.440 --> 25:54.160
Now, Shen Zaiye has the evidence.

25:55.600 --> 25:56.960
We're finished now.

25:59.440 --> 26:00.400
Where are you going?

26:01.000 --> 26:01.960
Give me some time.

26:02.040 --> 26:03.280
I'll find a way to settle this.

26:03.920 --> 26:04.720
I have

26:05.880 --> 26:07.840
no patience to wait anymore.

26:08.640 --> 26:10.800
The moment Shen Zaiye shows his face

26:12.280 --> 26:15.160
will be the moment he dies by an arrow.

26:26.000 --> 26:28.200
To what do I owe the honor
of your invitation?

26:28.280 --> 26:30.000
Though everything was arranged
in advance,

26:30.280 --> 26:32.320
that prison rescue
wouldn't have gone so smoothly

26:32.520 --> 26:34.320
if you hadn't notified
Prince Wuxia in time.

26:35.400 --> 26:36.680
You're giving me too much credit.

26:37.280 --> 26:38.760
I only did what the plan required.

26:39.600 --> 26:41.920
Just like you said in the silver mine.

26:42.480 --> 26:43.520
Since we came together,

26:43.680 --> 26:44.800
so we leave together.

26:46.120 --> 26:47.400
There's no way

26:47.560 --> 26:49.000
I'd let you walk

26:49.080 --> 26:50.280
into danger alone.

27:14.560 --> 27:15.160
Jiang Taohua.

27:15.400 --> 27:16.000
Jiang Taohua!

27:16.960 --> 27:17.680
Now,

27:18.600 --> 27:19.480
I've finally saved you

27:20.680 --> 27:22.000
for once.

27:25.920 --> 27:26.640
Jiang Taohua,

27:27.400 --> 27:28.520
Jiang Taohua!

27:41.640 --> 27:42.240
Your Highness!

27:47.240 --> 27:48.200
Zhan Lu, get the medicine!

27:48.280 --> 27:48.880
Yes, sir.

27:54.920 --> 27:55.520
Knife.

28:13.200 --> 28:13.840
Hold her steady.

28:14.120 --> 28:14.840
All right.

28:30.520 --> 28:31.120
Zhan Lu,

28:31.320 --> 28:32.520
where's the imperial physician?

28:32.600 --> 28:33.880
Why isn't he here yet?

28:35.000 --> 28:35.800
There, he's here.

28:36.040 --> 28:36.880
He's here.

28:37.920 --> 28:39.000
Chancellor Shen, don't worry.

28:39.080 --> 28:41.560
Imperial Physician Li is highly skilled,
especially in treating arrow wounds.

28:41.640 --> 28:43.400
Lady Jiang will pull through.

28:43.480 --> 28:44.840
I'll leave it to you,
Imperial Physician Li.

29:07.200 --> 29:09.360
Thank you for saving Lady Jiang's life,
Your Majesty.

29:09.440 --> 29:10.600
As long as she's safe,

29:11.040 --> 29:12.240
you can rest easy now.

29:13.680 --> 29:15.560
The audacity of these people.

29:16.120 --> 29:18.680
How dare they attack someone
inside the royal hunting grounds!

29:19.160 --> 29:19.760
Your Majesty,

29:20.400 --> 29:22.000
Lady Jiang took the arrow meant for me.

29:22.160 --> 29:23.200
If not for her,

29:23.480 --> 29:25.280
I would've been the one being shot.

29:26.280 --> 29:27.280
Please, I beg Your Majesty

29:27.400 --> 29:28.600
to investigate this thoroughly.

29:33.440 --> 29:34.040
Minister Shen,

29:34.600 --> 29:35.240
rise.

29:38.280 --> 29:39.520
Even if you don't bring this up,

29:39.800 --> 29:41.280
I would never let this go.

29:42.120 --> 29:43.600
Someone will pay the price.

29:45.000 --> 29:45.640
Commander Zhang.

29:45.720 --> 29:46.520
Yes, Your Majesty.

29:47.280 --> 29:48.160
Find me that assassin

29:48.840 --> 29:50.680
at all costs!

29:51.040 --> 29:51.680
Yes, Your Majesty.

29:55.720 --> 29:56.400
Search everywhere!

29:56.960 --> 29:57.600
Keep searching!

29:58.200 --> 29:58.800
Move it!

29:59.920 --> 30:00.760
Search this area!

30:01.240 --> 30:01.840
Yes, sir.

30:03.040 --> 30:03.640
Keep moving!

30:07.040 --> 30:07.680
Search the area!

30:14.200 --> 30:15.400
What is the situation outside?

30:19.160 --> 30:20.880
Was this your doing?

30:21.040 --> 30:21.920
No, it wasn't me.

30:24.200 --> 30:25.760
I did hire the assassins at first.

30:26.160 --> 30:27.520
But I called it off.

30:27.800 --> 30:30.120
It wasn't worth the risk,
especially under Father's nose.

30:35.040 --> 30:36.200
You don't believe me?

30:44.080 --> 30:45.800
If you strike a tiger
but fail to kill it,

30:46.080 --> 30:47.320
it'll bite back.

30:48.800 --> 30:50.160
With someone like Shen Zaiye,

30:50.800 --> 30:52.520
but we fail to take him out.

30:53.440 --> 30:54.320
During this time,

30:55.120 --> 30:56.600
we must stay quiet for now.

30:57.520 --> 30:59.080
Can I trust you to lie low?

31:00.160 --> 31:00.760
Yes.

31:01.520 --> 31:02.120
I promise.

31:03.120 --> 31:04.200
When have I ever

31:04.920 --> 31:06.280
said no to you?

31:07.280 --> 31:08.680
There's no solid evidence.

31:09.440 --> 31:10.680
With your position,

31:11.120 --> 31:12.080
you don't need to worry.

31:13.720 --> 31:14.920
I will write to my father

31:15.000 --> 31:16.760
and request him to come
as soon as possible.

31:19.440 --> 31:20.280
It's strange, though.

31:22.640 --> 31:24.920
Who ordered the attack?

31:27.040 --> 31:28.400
Who cares?

31:29.840 --> 31:30.800
Shen Zaiye probably

31:30.880 --> 31:32.360
has enemies everywhere.

31:33.520 --> 31:35.920
It's a pity that the little wife took
the hit instead.

31:37.400 --> 31:39.160
Talk about devotion.

31:46.080 --> 31:47.440
Your Highness, drink the medicine.

31:47.920 --> 31:49.440
If you don't, you won't get better.

31:51.760 --> 31:53.240
This physician is useless.

31:53.400 --> 31:55.360
Didn't he say she would be fine
after removing the arrow?

31:55.440 --> 31:57.520
Why is she still burning up?

32:02.120 --> 32:02.760
Let me do it.

32:04.880 --> 32:06.040
No need to trouble yourself.

33:21.120 --> 33:22.240
Isn't your only concern

33:22.960 --> 33:24.360
your own survival?

33:32.200 --> 33:33.480
Lady Jiang still hasn't woken up.

33:34.080 --> 33:35.120
If this keeps up,

33:35.480 --> 33:36.080
I'm afraid…

33:37.680 --> 33:39.200
I heard there's a temple nearby.

33:39.280 --> 33:40.600
I'll go and pray for Her Highness.

33:41.560 --> 33:43.040
That place has been abandoned for years.

33:43.120 --> 33:44.120
No worshipers pray there anymore.

33:44.200 --> 33:45.040
It's useless.

33:46.000 --> 33:48.520
Besides, Chancellor Shen hates
anything to do with superstition.

33:48.600 --> 33:49.720
You'll only make him angry.

34:17.760 --> 34:19.159
(Since the witchcraft scandal,)

34:20.159 --> 34:21.880
(I've never believed
in gods or spirits.)

34:24.400 --> 34:25.560
(But today,)

34:27.040 --> 34:28.320
(I've come)

34:28.840 --> 34:29.840
(for one reason alone.)

34:32.280 --> 34:34.920
(When I plotted with Prince Wuhen
to stage that assassination,)

34:35.600 --> 34:37.800
(I knew if I wanted
to take down Prince Wugou)

34:38.440 --> 34:39.560
(and the Meng family,)

34:40.560 --> 34:42.679
(I had to use myself as bait.)

34:43.239 --> 34:46.000
(Only then will His Majesty finally
be willing to uproot the aristocracy.)

34:47.520 --> 34:49.000
(But I never imagined Jiang Taohua)

34:50.199 --> 34:51.800
(would take that arrow for me.)

34:54.679 --> 34:59.120
♪That peace you longed for♪

34:59.320 --> 35:04.680
♪I was the one who had to take it away♪

35:06.040 --> 35:10.760
♪You weren't falling,
no need to feel all the sorrow and joy♪

35:11.800 --> 35:16.680
♪I wasn't someone meant
to wait and hope♪

35:17.560 --> 35:21.880
♪Don't blame my affection
for bringing you cold winds♪

35:22.160 --> 35:23.840
♪We were both unwilling to give in♪

35:23.920 --> 35:25.280
(What happened to Taohua)

35:25.480 --> 35:26.360
(was all my doing.)

35:27.560 --> 35:29.160
(I know my sins run deep.)

35:30.160 --> 35:31.960
(But don't let the innocent suffer
from it.)

35:33.560 --> 35:34.840
(Oh, merciful Buddha.)

35:36.240 --> 35:37.280
(Let Taohua)

35:38.600 --> 35:40.000
(regain consciousness.)

35:40.080 --> 35:44.320
♪Worn out from wandering,
with no shelter to rest beneath♪

35:44.720 --> 35:47.320
♪You never complained♪

35:47.520 --> 35:49.840
♪And I lay awake♪

35:50.280 --> 35:56.120
♪Who ever pitied us
in those long, cold, uncertain years?♪

35:57.520 --> 36:01.920
♪What I offer now feels like the guilt
of not loving well enough♪

36:02.880 --> 36:07.440
♪Do you know love,
when left unspoken, quietly fades?♪

36:07.640 --> 36:11.960
♪Among a noisy crowd of strangers♪

36:14.680 --> 36:19.960
♪Where petals fall and quiet words
are spoken over a game♪

36:20.480 --> 36:25.920
♪Tears draw out more tears
and what's seen is are not truly seen♪

36:26.120 --> 36:31.200
♪If you walk away, looking back♪

36:31.920 --> 36:37.880
♪How many more years will I lose again?♪

36:40.520 --> 36:44.600
♪The brokenness buried in your brow♪

36:45.120 --> 36:50.360
♪Reflects all the vastness between us♪

36:51.880 --> 36:56.200
♪Thankfully, fate bent down just enough♪

36:56.440 --> 37:03.440
♪To gather the love we once left behind♪

37:03.840 --> 37:04.560
You're awake.

37:08.120 --> 37:09.360
Chancellor Shen…

37:15.080 --> 37:16.080
It's all right now.

37:17.240 --> 37:18.320
I'll go get Qingtai.

38:02.040 --> 38:02.640
She's awake.

38:03.080 --> 38:04.000
Her Highness is awake.

38:04.320 --> 38:05.800
Your Highness,
I knew you would be okay.

38:05.880 --> 38:06.960
Now that Lady Jiang is awake,

38:07.040 --> 38:08.440
you can finally rest easy.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.040
By the way,

38:11.280 --> 38:13.160
Prince Wugou has been holed up
in his tent lately.

38:13.240 --> 38:14.280
He didn't even step outside.

38:14.760 --> 38:15.760
He sure can hold it in.

38:16.280 --> 38:17.440
He won't be patient for long.

38:19.760 --> 38:20.400
Also,

38:20.480 --> 38:21.800
although Lady Jiang is conscious,

38:22.480 --> 38:23.640
she remains very weak.

38:24.000 --> 38:26.160
She mustn't hear a word
about the assassination attempt.

38:26.240 --> 38:27.320
So she can recover in peace.

38:27.400 --> 38:28.400
No one should disturb her.

38:28.480 --> 38:29.080
Understand?

38:29.160 --> 38:30.360
Chancellor Shen, rest assured.

38:32.480 --> 38:33.760
Your Highness, have some congee.

38:44.960 --> 38:46.280
Why are you looking at me like that?

38:46.360 --> 38:47.400
Don't you recognize me?

38:49.080 --> 38:50.600
You have no idea
what I went through.

38:50.920 --> 38:52.800
When Chancellor Shen carried
you back here,

38:53.360 --> 38:54.360
I thought…

38:55.160 --> 38:56.080
I thought we lost you.

38:57.160 --> 38:58.520
Changjue hasn't been rescued yet.

38:59.000 --> 39:00.880
How could I possibly
let anything happen to me?

39:02.920 --> 39:05.560
I overheard Prince Wugou
and Meng Huaijin.

39:05.800 --> 39:07.320
They plan to kill the Chancellor today.

39:10.560 --> 39:12.080
(Since I know what's coming,)

39:12.560 --> 39:13.680
(I've prepared in advance.)

39:18.080 --> 39:18.680
Qingtai,

39:19.680 --> 39:21.440
smooth out the edges
of this shard for me.

39:21.720 --> 39:22.480
Yes, Your Highness.

39:26.840 --> 39:27.600
(Taking that arrow)

39:28.560 --> 39:30.280
(was simply to play along
with their plan.)

39:34.240 --> 39:35.400
But that was far too dangerous!

39:35.480 --> 39:37.400
How could you risk your life like that?

39:40.040 --> 39:41.320
I had to take the gamble.

39:42.440 --> 39:45.440
I cannot rely on cooperation

39:45.520 --> 39:46.600
and submission to survive.

39:47.440 --> 39:48.800
I want him to be the key

39:48.880 --> 39:50.880
that breaks me free
from Empress Lv's control.

39:53.600 --> 39:54.320
(But)

39:55.920 --> 39:58.400
(the medicine and physician
did arrive suspiciously fast.)

40:00.040 --> 40:01.640
(Almost as if they were expecting it.)

40:04.120 --> 40:04.880
But

40:05.120 --> 40:06.280
you may not realize it.

40:06.680 --> 40:09.120
When you rushed forward that day,
you looked so sincere.

40:09.200 --> 40:11.000
It really didn't seem like
you were acting.

40:11.200 --> 40:13.520
Even I almost believed

40:13.600 --> 40:15.600
that you had actually fallen
for the Chancellor.

40:15.880 --> 40:17.120
You scared me half to death.

40:19.000 --> 40:20.480
I was unconscious for days.

40:20.920 --> 40:23.720
Did Shen Zaiye do anything unusual?

40:24.080 --> 40:25.880
Just thinking about it makes me mad.

40:26.440 --> 40:27.760
The moment you started to recover,

40:27.880 --> 40:29.560
he and Zhan Lu vanished without a word.

40:30.040 --> 40:31.320
They were sneaking around,

40:31.400 --> 40:32.680
and who knows what they're up to.

40:33.040 --> 40:34.800
You nearly died saving him.

40:34.880 --> 40:36.600
But he didn't even look
the slightest bit worried!

40:37.680 --> 40:38.440
Your Highness,

40:38.600 --> 40:40.800
I think your plan didn't work.

40:41.240 --> 40:42.160
You took that arrow

40:42.240 --> 40:43.280
for nothing.

41:17.600 --> 41:19.800
Chancellor Shen told us not
to disturb Princess Taohua.

41:19.960 --> 41:21.280
But she asked me to come

41:21.360 --> 41:22.400
and keep her company.

41:23.720 --> 41:24.960
So you're saying

41:25.400 --> 41:26.800
you brought this barbecue

41:26.880 --> 41:28.280
just to lift her spirits?

41:28.520 --> 41:30.960
Of course.
We'll be chatting and grilling meat.

41:34.960 --> 41:35.760
Let's go.

41:40.720 --> 41:42.560
Prince Wuxia, Qingying.

41:43.240 --> 41:44.080
You're here.

41:45.240 --> 41:46.720
My brother said not to disturb you.

41:46.920 --> 41:49.880
But since you invited me,
this doesn't count as my fault, right?

41:50.920 --> 41:51.520
Come.

41:52.120 --> 41:52.720
Have a seat.

41:53.120 --> 41:54.960
You better explain this clearly
to my brother.

41:55.080 --> 41:55.960
Or he'll punish me.

41:56.280 --> 41:57.000
Of course, I will.

42:02.200 --> 42:03.480
You know I can't eat meat

42:03.560 --> 42:04.600
because of my injuries.

42:05.040 --> 42:06.720
But you brought a barbecue just for me.

42:07.320 --> 42:08.640
That's thoughtful of you.

42:08.880 --> 42:09.680
Of course.

42:09.880 --> 42:11.480
I'm nothing if not considerate.

42:13.880 --> 42:16.000
I've been unconscious for days.

42:17.400 --> 42:18.640
I'm sorry for troubling everyone.

42:18.720 --> 42:20.000
I hope I didn't scare any of you.

42:20.240 --> 42:20.960
Scared? Please.

42:21.600 --> 42:23.160
Do you think I get scared that easily?

42:32.320 --> 42:33.880
But Qingtai said

42:34.360 --> 42:36.120
even the physician thought
it was serious.

42:37.440 --> 42:38.520
It was serious.

42:38.720 --> 42:40.520
Even my brother,
who never believed in gods or spirits,

42:40.600 --> 42:42.680
went all the way to a temple to pray
for your recovery.

42:42.880 --> 42:44.040
Luckily, you're tough enough

42:44.120 --> 42:44.760
to pull through.

42:52.280 --> 42:53.080
Miss Qingying,

42:53.320 --> 42:54.480
grilling in the tent

42:54.560 --> 42:55.920
is really too smoky.

42:56.720 --> 42:58.840
Princess Taohua is still recovering.

42:59.160 --> 43:00.360
And if a fire starts,

43:00.440 --> 43:01.440
it'll be chaos.

43:01.800 --> 43:02.960
It's just barbecue!

43:03.120 --> 43:04.560
It's not like it'll go up in flames.

43:06.920 --> 43:07.880
All right. That's enough.

43:08.760 --> 43:09.760
Let's play pitch-pot instead.

43:09.840 --> 43:10.440
What do you think?

43:10.520 --> 43:11.680
But the meat's not done yet.

43:11.760 --> 43:12.760
Come on. Let's go.

43:12.840 --> 43:14.120
No, it's not cooked yet.

43:14.320 --> 43:15.520
I'll send someone to clean up.

43:15.840 --> 43:16.480
Come on. Let's go.

43:16.560 --> 43:17.720
Let me finish grilling first.

43:24.280 --> 43:26.680
Is Miss Qingying trying
to smoke you in here?

43:27.680 --> 43:28.440
For heaven's sake.

43:33.400 --> 43:34.760
Are you all right, Your Highness?

43:37.280 --> 43:39.400
Qingtai, my plan worked.

43:40.560 --> 43:41.680
For someone like him,

43:42.080 --> 43:43.760
he actually prays for me in a temple.

44:08.560 --> 44:11.760
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

44:11.840 --> 44:14.880
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

44:15.800 --> 44:18.920
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

44:19.040 --> 44:22.800
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

44:23.080 --> 44:26.160
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

44:26.280 --> 44:29.600
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

44:30.000 --> 44:33.560
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

44:33.640 --> 44:39.360
♪With no one it can be brought♪

44:44.320 --> 44:51.240
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

44:51.680 --> 44:58.520
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

44:59.000 --> 45:06.000
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

45:06.320 --> 45:10.360
♪Even if it means this flower♪

45:10.480 --> 45:17.440
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

45:28.560 --> 45:31.680
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

45:31.760 --> 45:35.000
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

45:35.360 --> 45:39.040
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

45:39.160 --> 45:45.720
♪No longer needing to say♪

45:49.800 --> 45:56.720
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

45:57.120 --> 46:04.080
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

46:04.440 --> 46:11.440
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

46:11.800 --> 46:13.480
♪And finding♪

46:13.560 --> 46:20.560
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
